Modifications: the Codex app-server and broker runtime were replaced with
one-shot `dst run --json` executions for DSH (DeepSeek Harness); there are no
review commands in this plugin; the model and reasoning effort are selected
with a bundled overlay patch that reads the DSH_LAUNCH_PROVIDER /
DSH_LAUNCH_MODEL / DSH_LAUNCH_EFFORT environment variables; the job-tracking
and companion structure of the `opencode` plugin is reused; Codex-specific
features (session transfer, GPT prompting skill, model aliases) were removed;
command, skill, agent, and test names were changed from Codex/OpenCode to
DSH. Changed JavaScript files carry a "Modified from openai/codex-plugin-cc"
header; the command, agent, skill, and prompt Markdown files were also
adapted.

